  "_comment": "Warm-up cards running past one sentence (engine/dev/warmupOrder.mjs). A warm-up card is read standing in the world with a run about to start, so the cap is one sentence — against four for a day card and five for the opening, all three counted by engine/dev/dayCard.mjs. The importer's twelve-word floor on `why` still applies, so the target is one sentence of twelve or more words. A card not listed here fails now if it runs long; one listed here that has since been cut fails too, naming the line to delete. Recorded when the cap went in, so the cards that predate it are visible debt rather than a wall of failures nobody reads.",
